    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your numbers up in this Top down Collectathon Target Practice Shooter - One miss and you lose the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot at the target and jewels come out, shoot the jewels before they fall too far to collect them and increase your money and points in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More points and jewels are given the further you shoot a target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship moves around automatically, you aim by rotating the ship to aim at the target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The target gets smaller the more targets that you shoot to make it more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One miss and you lose the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.poster.avif?t=1747595992\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.webm?t=1747595992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.mp4?t=1747595992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a skill based game, where your reaction and aim are tested. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get better at aiming the more that you play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you get at aiming the more fun it is as you see your numbers going up fast as you get more money, points and targets hit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard or Xbox Controller (untested on other gamepads)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High score</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and beat your high scores including number of targets hit, number of points and money from the jewels that you collect. Watch as your numbers go up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your numbers up in this Top down Collectathon Target Practice Shooter - One miss and you lose the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot at the target and jewels come out, shoot the jewels before they fall too far to collect them and increase your money and points in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More points and jewels are given the further you shoot a target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship moves around automatically, you aim by rotating the ship to aim at the target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The target gets smaller the more targets that you shoot to make it more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One miss and you lose the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.poster.avif?t=1747595992\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.webm?t=1747595992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.mp4?t=1747595992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a skill based game, where your reaction and aim are tested. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get better at aiming the more that you play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you get at aiming the more fun it is as you see your numbers going up fast as you get more money, points and targets hit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard or Xbox Controller (untested on other gamepads)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High score</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and beat your high scores including number of targets hit, number of points and money from the jewels that you collect. Watch as your numbers go up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In this numbers go up collectathon target practice shooter, one miss and you lose the game. Use and improve your aiming skills to get the most hits, points and money from jewels. Get more jewels and points the further your ship is from the target. Target gets smaller on each target hit.",
